---
export const prerender = true;

import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { agent } from '../data/agent';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { project, verified } from '../data/project';

const projectName = verified(project.name) ?? 'the development featured on this website';
const developer = verified(project.developer);
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Disclaimer | Independent property marketing website"
  description="The basis on which project information, pricing, availability, images, floor areas and distances are presented on this independent marketing website."
  pathname="/disclaimer"
  heading="Disclaimer"
  intro="What the information on this website is — and what it is not."
>
  <h2>1. Independent marketing website</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>{site.legal.independentDisclosureFull}</strong>
  </p>
  <p>
    This website is not operated by, endorsed by, or affiliated with
    {developer ? ` ${developer}` : ' the developer'} or any of its related entities. No claim is made
    that the operator is the exclusive salesperson for {projectName}, or that {agent.agencyName} is the
    exclusive marketing agency for it. Where the words “official”, “exclusive” or “direct developer” do
    not appear on this website, that is deliberate.
  </p>

  <h2>2. General information only</h2>
  <ul>
    {site.legal.projectDisclaimer.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Prices and availability</h2>
  <p>
    Any price shown is indicative only. Prices, price ranges, price-per-square-foot figures,
    maintenance estimates, payment schedules, unit availability and any promotional arrangement are
    determined by the developer, change between sales phases, and are confirmed only in the
    developer-issued price list and unit chart current at the time of booking.
  </p>
  <p>
    Figures shown exclude Buyer’s Stamp Duty, Additional Buyer’s Stamp Duty where applicable, legal
    fees, and other costs of the transaction. No discount, rebate, guaranteed entry price or
    preferential arrangement is offered or implied anywhere on this website.
  </p>

  <h2>4. No investment claims</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this website should be read as a forecast or promise about capital appreciation,
    rental yield, rental demand, resale value, resale demand, or the timing or profitability of any
    exit. Property prices can fall as well as rise. No guarantee of loan approval is given or
    implied. Obtain independent financial advice appropriate to your circumstances.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Images and visualisations</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legal.imageDisclaimer} Renders and artists’ impressions may depict landscaping, furniture, fittings,
    finishes, views and surroundings that are not part of the sale and that may differ from what is delivered.
    Views shown are not guaranteed and may be affected by future development on neighbouring sites.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Floorplans and floor areas</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legal.floorplanDisclaimer} Layouts, dimensions and orientations are indicative and subject to
    change and to final survey. Refer to the plans annexed to the Sale and Purchase Agreement.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Distances, travel times and amenities</h2>
  <p>
    Distances, walking times and driving times shown on this website are approximate unless
    expressly marked as verified, and are provided for general guidance. Driving times vary
    substantially with traffic and time of day. The presence of an amenity nearby is not a
    representation that it will remain, or that access to it is assured.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Schools</h2>
  <p>
    Proximity to a school does not guarantee admission. Admission to Singapore primary schools is
    determined by the Ministry of Education through its registration phases and applicable distance
    categories, which are reviewed from time to time. Verify the current position at moe.gov.sg
    before relying on it.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Future infrastructure and surroundings</h2>
  <p>
    References to announced or planned infrastructure reflect information published by the relevant
    agencies at the time of writing. Announced plans are not commitments: routes, station locations,
    land use and timelines are revised, deferred and occasionally cancelled. Land near the
    development may be developed in ways that change the outlook, noise levels or traffic
    conditions.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Third-party materials</h2>
  <p>
    Project names, logos, brochures, plans and renders remain the property of their respective
    owners. They appear here, where they appear at all, to identify and market the development. If
    you own material published here and wish it corrected or removed, contact {agent.email}.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Errors and omissions</h2>
  <p>
    While reasonable care is taken, no warranty is given as to the accuracy, completeness or
    currency of anything on this website. Errors and omissions are excepted. Any reliance you place
    on this information is at your own risk, and you should verify anything material to your
    decision against the developer’s official documents before committing.
  </p>

  <h2>12. Identification</h2>
  <p>
    {agent.fullName} · CEA registration {agent.ceaRegistrationNumber} · {agent.agencyName} · estate agency
    licence {agent.agencyLicenceNumber} · {agent.mobileDisplay} · {agent.email}
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
